{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cardrottini</strong> is a fast-paced, turn-based card battler powered by the most unhinged corners of Italian internet culture. From Tung Tung Tung Sahur to Ballerina Capuccina and Tralalero Tralala, every card is a tribute to the beautiful nonsense that clogs your feed at 2AM.<br><br>What You\u2019ll Be Doing:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf <strong>Build Ridiculous Decks:</strong> Collect and combine cards based on viral characters, chaotic catchphrases, and pure meme energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Outplay or Outweird:</strong> Outsmart opponents with clever strategies - or just throw the weirdest combo possible and hope they tilt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Play With (or Against) Friends:</strong> Casual duels or competitive ranked matches, full of emotional damage and unexpected laughter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Regular Drops of Madness:</strong> New cards, seasonal events, and community-fueled chaos. The meta may not exist. That\u2019s the point.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you know, you know. If you don\u2019t\u2026 you will.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723480?t=1747393190","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723480?t=1747393190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723480/96bd0c3de19c5e3ab76c54bc0a1dccb8c38fed53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747393190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723480/96bd0c3de19c5e3ab76c54bc0a1dccb8c38fed53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747393190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id